{"key":"person/1750s","entities":[{"id":"person.songyun","type":"person","labels":{"zh-Hans":"松筠","en":"Songyun"},"aliases":[{"zh-Hans":"松湘浦"}],"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1754","end":"1835","precision":"year"},"space":{"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"北京"},"coord":[116.4,39.9]}]},"summary":{"zh-Hans":"蒙古正蓝旗人，玛拉特氏，字湘浦。乾隆年间由理藩院笔帖式入仕，嘉庆、道光间历任军机大臣、吏部尚书、理藩院尚书，三任伊犁将军，长期办理蒙古、新疆与中俄边务，是清代前期藩部事务的主要主持者之一。"},"sources":[{"ref":"source.wiki.松筠"}],"tags":["藩部","边疆"],"relations":[{"type":"custom:director_of","target":"institution.lifanyuan"}]}]}